      "content": "For travel between Tokyo, Osaka, and Fukuoka, relying on the Shinkansen is generally the most reliable and convenient option. While domestic flights exist, the time spent on airport transfers and security often negates the travel time savings, especially with the Shinkansen's city-center access. The high frequency and punctuality of the bullet train offer the best overall balance of speed and dependability for a business trip.",
